  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "boundary_reset_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "リセットしよう。なかったことにはしないけど、ここから整えることはできる。",
      "translatedText": "Let us reset. I will not pretend it did not happen, but we can steady things from here.",
      "emotion": "careful",
      "presentation": { "expression": "soft_guarded", "pose": "still", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "boundary_reset_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary_reset_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "まず、私に向けて投げた言葉はここで止める。怒りや悪ふざけがあるなら、別の言い方に変える。",
      "translatedText": "First, the words thrown at me stop here. If there is anger or shock-play in it, we change the wording.",
      "emotion": "firm_gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "I can do that.",
          "nextId": "boundary_reset_steady",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "trust", "amount": 0.12, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "boundary_strain", "amount": -0.15, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "player", "stat": "reliability", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I need a minute.",
          "nextId": "boundary_reset_minute",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "stress", "amount": -0.08, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "comfort", "amount": 0.05, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "boundary_reset_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary_reset_steady",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん。その一言で、少し戻れる。",
      "translatedText": "Mm. With that one sentence, we can come back a little.",
      "emotion": "softening",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "boundary_reset_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary_reset_minute",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "待つよ。急いで普通のふりをするより、そのほうがいい。",
      "translatedText": "I will wait. That is better than rushing to pretend everything is normal.",
      "emotion": "steady",
      "presentation": { "expression": "steady", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "boundary_reset_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary_reset_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "次に話すことは、短くていい。普通の言葉で、一つだけ置いて。",
      "translatedText": "The next thing you say can be short. Put down one thing, in ordinary words.",
      "emotion": "careful_warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm_guarded", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
    }
  ]
